OL,3,GNEWSASupply 'restored' after burst main
OL,4,Acauses flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burst water main on the edge of
OL,7,FBristol has caused flooding, and
OL,8,Fhundreds of residents experiencing low
OL,9,Fwater pressure or no supply for much of
OL,10,Fthe day.
OL,12,FBristol Water said properties in the
OL,13,FBS34, BS32, BS7 and BS10 postcodes were
OL,14,Faffected by the burst main between
OL,15,FHammond Road and Hayes Way in Patchway.
OL,17,FAn update posted by the water company
OL,18,Fon social media at 18:00 BST said
OL,19,F"customers should now be seeing their
OL,20,Fsupplies restored while repairs
OL,21,Fcontinue".
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,342,340,200,160,0,100
