OL,3,GNEWSASupply 'restored' after burst main
OL,4,Acauses flooding
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leak initially impacted 8,813
OL,7,Fcustomers, but the spokesperson said
OL,8,Fthat had reduced to 1,442 and added the
OL,9,Ffirm was looking to deliver bottled
OL,10,Fwater to its most vulnerable customers.
